WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.990
Walk into one church, and a huge
pulpit stands high in the centre.

2
00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:09.400
Walk into another, and your eye
is drawn to a locked golden box,

3
00:00:09.450 --> 00:00:11.940
with a red lamp burning beside it.

4
00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:14.820
In a third, there are
just chairs in a circle,

5
00:00:14.870 --> 00:00:17.690
around a table, and silence.

6
00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:20.470
So why does one church
have a giant pulpit,

7
00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:24.380
and another a golden box with
a lamp burning beside it?

8
00:00:24.430 --> 00:00:27.240
In this mission, you'll
learn to name the features,

9
00:00:27.290 --> 00:00:30.150
from font to lectern to altar.

10
00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:33.560
Then you'll compare four
kinds of church side by side:

11
00:00:33.610 --> 00:00:37.340
Catholic, Orthodox,
Free Church and Quaker.

12
00:00:37.390 --> 00:00:41.870
Your mission: find out why church
buildings look so different inside.
